B) \displaystyle \mathbf{E}(R_{p}<r<R)\;=\;\dfrac{2\,\mathbf{P}_{0}}{3\,\varepsilon_{0}}\;\Bigl(\dfrac{R_{p}^{3}}{r^{3}}\Bigr)\,\hat{\mathbf{z}}
