\;=\;\varepsilon_{0}\,\dfrac{\mathbf{P}_{0}}{3\varepsilon_{0}}\!\left[2\!\left(\dfrac{R_{p}}{r}\right)^{3}-1\right]\hat{\mathbf{z}}
\;=\;\dfrac{\mathbf{P}_{0}}{3}\Bigl[2\!\left(\dfrac{R_{p}}{r}\right)^{3}-1\Bigr]\hat{\mathbf{z}}\;.

